   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Collaboration and coordination between Ministry of Environment (MoE) and Ministry of Economy and Finance (MEF) on green finance strengthened, and dialogue between these authorities and other stakeholders (both government and non-government) enhanced.
2. Technical capacities of MoE and MEF on processes, approaches and methodologies to assess, access and implement green finance options (starting with green bonds) enhanced.
3. Enhanced capacities to negotiate and forge partnerships with potential providers of green finance. Number of new proposal developed.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Limited coordination
2. Cambodia has not issued green bonds yet.
3. 0</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. At least two joint policy briefs/ dialogues issued/ organized by MoE and MEF, outlining a common vision and concrete steps for mobilizing specific green financial resources.
2. A feasibility study on green bonds completed.
3. At least 1</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. 2 (Policy dialogue on Climate Action, study visit to Vietnam to learn about Extended Producer Responsibility scheme, organized jointly with MEF and MoE)
2. Feasibility study on green bond completed (draft report shared with government)
3. 0 - Submission of project idea for GEF 8 integrated programme on eco-system restoration to the Pre-investment Screening Committee. Expected to submit Expression of Interest to GEF secretariat Quarter 1, 2023.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
